    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape of the School is a first-person horror game set in an abandoned Brazilian school, where a brutal massacre occurred 20 years ago. Now, you wake up trapped in this forgotten place \u2014 and you are not alone.The murderous teacher still roams the halls, hungry for new visitors. Explore dark rooms, collect clues, uncover buried secrets, and survive by using stealth and reasoning.With references to Brazilian culture, urban legends, and a suffocating atmosphere, this unique experience promises to keep you captivated from start to finish \u2014 or until your last breath.</p>",
